<title>BELGIUM: EU to clear Boeing deal in principle - EU sources.</title>
<headline>EU to clear Boeing deal in principle - EU sources.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission is expected to clear the merger between Boeing Co and McDonnell Douglas in principle later on Wednesday, EU sources said.</p>
<p>&quot;I believe we will have a decision in principle...subject to verification of the details at a later stage,&quot; one source said. Another source said that the concessions made by Boeing in a last-minute proposal on Tuesday were &quot;significant&quot; and that the Commission was likely to give its approval to the $15 billion merger.</p>
<p>&quot;There will be no formal decision today, the aim is to approve it politically,&quot; a third source said, adding that the formal decision would come in several days.</p>
</text>
